silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_24_rosetta_stone_cross_domain_sections_01_forge_engineer_entry_point_concrete_anchor_1 silm:hasExample "In 'S01ForgeEngineerEntryPointConcreteAnchor1', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the forge input class Cat: any cat-typed source object entering the production pipeline; concrete example: a stray rescued at the F11 shelter on 2026-02-10, body-mass 3.8 kg, not yet classified as DomesticCat." .
